+## Recommendation
+
+Recommended line: Line A
+
+Line A's overall/blended defect rate (4.5%) looks worse than Line B's aggregate rate (3.4%), but that gap is an artifact of product mix, not process quality: once defect rate is computed per variant, Line A wins on both Standard and Pro.
+
+## Supporting Figures
+
+| Line | Variant | Defect Rate (%) | Mix (%) |
+|------|---------|------------------|---------|
+| Line A | Standard | 2.1 | 45 |
+| Line A | Pro | 6.4 | 55 |
+| Line B | Standard | 2.6 | 85 |
+| Line B | Pro | 7.8 | 15 |
